From: Chimera core
Subject: [PATCH] the core's memory tools see the RAM

With SUPERMODEL_CHIMERA, CModel3 hands the core pointers to its main RAM
and its backup RAM, which the core publishes as memory domains for
Chimera's memory tools (RAM Watch, RAM Search, Lua's memory functions).
---
--- a/Src/Model3/Model3.h
+++ b/Src/Model3/Model3.h
@@ -99,6 +99,11 @@
   Result Init(const Game &game, const ROMSet &rom_set) override;
   // For Scripting tweaks
   Util::Config::Node& GetConfig() { return this->m_config; }
+#ifdef SUPERMODEL_CHIMERA
+  // the Chimera core's memory tools (RAM Watch, RAM Search) read these
+  UINT8 *ChimeraRAM(void) { return ram; }
+  UINT8 *ChimeraBackupRAM(void) { return backupRAM; }
+#endif
 
   // IPCIDevice interface
   UINT32 ReadPCIConfigSpace(unsigned device, unsigned reg, unsigned bits, unsigned offset) const override;
